# Generated by forge build from forge/seed and the checkout's fixes. Do not edit: see docs/FORGE.md, "Fixing a generated guide".
# Ashenvale, Alliance ~33.5 to 34, then Menethil Harbor: the end of Raene's
# Cleansing, Kayneth's druids, Delgren's soul gems, the satyrs of Xavian;
# then the Wetlands turn-ins on the way to Stranglethorn.
#
# Flow: fly to Astranaar -> the western posts (Delgren, Melyria, Illiyana) ->
# Shael'dryn's moonwell and the Howling Vale -> Xavian, Satyrnaar and Forest
# Song -> the south-east (disease, chests, Fallen Sky Lake) and the insane
# druids -> Night Run and the hidden shrine -> Astranaar -> Krolg and Ran
# Bloodtooth -> Astranaar -> the western posts -> hearth, boat to Menethil ->
# Menethil turn-ins. Next guide: Stranglethorn Vale.
#
# Forever above level 30 cannot be checked in game until launch on 4
# November: the Forever additions here come from the data, not from play.
# Added from the consensus Ashenvale visit (12, 28.9-30.0), all Forever:
# - Seeking Caitlin (95737): Llana in Astranaar, handed to Caitlin Grassman
#   at the Menethil stop that closes this guide.
# - Gleaming Crescent Necklace (98027): the pendant lies north of Fallen Sky
#   Lake, on the way to the Oracle; Maliynn takes it in Astranaar.
# - Left out: Slowing the Orc Advance (86757): Shandrina sits at Mystral Lake,
#   which this loop reaches only at its end, while the Horde grunts and
#   scouts stand in the far east: a second crossing of the zone.
# - Left out: Shared Fury (98418): Maseara Autumnmoon in Forest Song offers it
#   only after Vengeful Trail (98417, a Vine-Wrapped Scroll found among the
#   Satyrnaar satyrs west of Forest Song): Forever's quest chain data,
#   checked 2026-10-17, and Shared
#   Fury's text reads from Kurothel's written words. The data has no
#   prerequisite and no spawn for the scroll, so the route cannot place
#   Vengeful Trail.
# Deviations from the simulator route (consensus, Alliance Human):
# - Ashenvale runs as one west-to-east loop and back: the western quests are
#   all taken on the first pass, Satyrnaar's soul and Geltharis are done
#   while in Xavian, and the route's mid-zone hearth is dropped (the
#   Astranaar bind is used once, to leave).
# - The route's bind at Menethil Harbor is dropped: Booty Bay replaces it in
#   the next guide before it is used.
# Left out:
# - Sentinel Basic Care Package (7863): a Silverwing Sentinels (Warsong
#   Gulch) reputation purchase, not a leveling quest.
# - Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak (565): the route marks it again here, but there
#   is nothing for it in Ashenvale; its fur is collected in Hillsbrad.
# - The Tower of Althalaxx (1167), Velinde Starsong (1037), Satyr Slaying!
#   (1032) and Blessed Arm (322): the route accepts them and never turns them
#   in.
# - Lost in the Thicket Things (95647) and Lost Relic Carry (95810): both
#   happen in the Excavation Site: Wetlands dungeon.
# Carried on: James Hyal (1302) and The Missing Diplomat (1264), turned in
# later on the route.
# Also left out: The Thandol Span (631), a ride to Dun Modr for one accept;
# the later Wetlands/Arathi visit passes Rhag Garmason anyway and can take it.
# Class quests: none in this stretch.
guide forever/alliance/30-40/03-ashenvale
title Ashenvale & Wetlands
faction Alliance
levels 33-35
zone Ashenvale
next forever/alliance/30-40/04-stranglethorn-vale

# v1 improved: order from the simulator's search (Human Alliance, 2000000 tries, seeded with v1's order;
# 125.7 h -> 117.5 h to 60 in the model), written by polestar apply-route.
# Added here: Velinde Starsong (1037), Blessed Arm (322).
# 1 goals moved in from other guides of the chain.
# The notes above describe v1's order; the steps below are the improved one.

step Astranaar
  sethome "Astranaar"
  accept 1035                         -- Pelturas Whitemoon, inside

step Dartol's Rod
  tip The Crazed and Withered Ancients north of the moonwell carry the Wooden Key; the worn chest it opens stands among them.
  collect 5475 "Wooden Key"
  collect 5464 quest 1026             -- Iron Shaft

step The Howling Vale
  tip Take the tunnel into the Howling Vale; the tome lies in the ruins at its west end.
  interact 19027 quest 1022.1         -- Tome of Mel'Thandris

step Shael'dryn
  turnin 1026
  accept 1027

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Xavian and Forest Song

step Anilia
  tip Follow the road east to the satyr camps of Xavian; Anilia hides at their edge.
  turnin 1021
  accept 1031

step Geltharis
  tip Geltharis leads the Xavian satyrs; he carries the branch.
  collect 5461 quest 1031             -- Branch of Cenarius

step Forest Song
  tip Forest Song, the Night Elf outpost at the eastern end of the road: Kayneth Stillwind stands there.
  turnin 4581                         -- Kayneth Stillwind
  accept 1011

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The south-east

step Bottle of Disease
  tip The Forsaken's camp lies in the woods south of Forest Song.
  tip Careful: Non-elite Forsaken of about level 28-30 guard the camp. Some of them are stealthed, and the ones around the table often aggro together.
  collect 5440 quest 1011             -- Bottle of Disease

step Kayneth Stillwind
  turnin 1011
  accept 1012

step Satyrnaar
  tip The Circle of Imprisonment stands in the satyr camp of Satyrnaar, further east along the road.
  tip Careful: The Felmusk Rogues in Night Run often go stealthed, and Satyrnaar has satyr casters.
  interact 20352 quest 1140.2         -- Circle of Imprisonment

step The Dor'Danil Barrow Den: kill these as you meet them
  zone Ashenvale
  tip The three druids stand together at the Forsaken camp south of Forest Song.
  tip Rusty chests lie around the Shadethicket furbolg camps west of the Forsaken; open them until one holds the pommel.
  tip Careful: The den has many mobs that respawn quickly, including stealthed undead and patrols, so extra mobs often join a fight.
  collect 5519 quest 1027             -- Iron Pommel
  kill 3941 quest 1012.2              -- Uthil Mooncall, inside The Dor'Danil Barrow Den
  kill 3940 quest 1012.1              -- Taneel Darkwood, inside The Dor'Danil Barrow Den
  kill 3942 quest 1012.3              -- Mavoris Cloudsbreak, inside The Dor'Danil Barrow Den

step Fallen Sky Lake
  tip The Shadethicket Oracle walks the shore of Fallen Sky Lake, south-west of the chests; the Gleaming Crescent Pendant lies north of the lake, on the way.
  tip Careful: Other mobs, some of them underwater, sit near the island. Clear them first so they don't join the fight when you pull the Oracle.
  collect 5508 quest 1035             -- Fallen Moonstone
  accept 98027 object 669176          -- Gleaming Crescent Pendant: for Maliynn in Astranaar

step Forest Song
  turnin 1012                         -- Kayneth Stillwind

